    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "body": "### Describe the bug\n\nOn cleanup, Cython's cache sorts by file access time and then removes files in reversed order. This deletes the most recently accessed file first.\n\nhttps://github.com/cython/cython/blob/68ba6a6db43cc5eec40401030063e1249e523759/Cython/Build/Cache.py#L188-L194\n\n### Code to reproduce the behaviour:\n\n_No response_\n\n### Expected behaviour\n\nThe intention was certainly to evict the least recently used entry.\n\n### OS\n\n_No response_\n\n### Python version\n\n_No response_\n\n### Cython version\n\nmaster and older versions\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_",
